  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest Menu has light blue on dark blue text, making the contrast more apparent would make the menu easier to read, especially on dark backgrounds. The small buttons also make it very difficult to locate and click the tabs you need such as opening the wings or accessing the camera. Providing an option to make this menu bigger or by making it bigger overall would prove to help those with a hard time selecting options (i.e. those with tremors in their hands, hard of sight, or other ailments). With this, adjusting the menu back to the previous menu where one click took you to your whole settings tab instead of this 2 menu system would be nice. For quicker adjustments in the moment.",
